------------------------------------------------------------
PROJECT NOTICE
------------------------------------------------------------

MediAI — Personalized Healthcare & Medicine Recommendation System

This project is developed for educational and research purposes.

The system demonstrates machine learning-based disease prediction,
medicine information retrieval, and medicine similarity recommendation
using publicly available datasets.

The predictions and recommendations generated by this project are
intended for demonstration and educational purposes only and must not
be considered medical advice, diagnosis, treatment, or a substitute
for consultation with a qualified healthcare professional.

The authors do not guarantee the accuracy, completeness, or clinical
suitability of the predictions or recommendations produced by the system.

Dataset sources and their respective licenses remain subject to the
terms and conditions specified by their original providers.
